ce srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Portrait_Jaryd.png/30px-Portrait_Jaryd.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2e/Portrait_Jaryd.png/45px-Portrait_Jaryd.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2e/Portrait_Jaryd.png/60px-Portrait_Jaryd.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Jaryd\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Portrait_Jaryd.png/30px-Portrait_Jaryd.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2e/Portrait_Jaryd.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Jaryd\" title=\"Jaryd\">Jaryd</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Merony\" title=\"Merony\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/aa/Portrait_Merony.png/30px-Portrait_Merony.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/aa/Portrait_Merony.png/45px-Portrait_Merony.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/aa/Portrait_Merony.png/60px-Portrait_Merony.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Merony\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/aa/Portrait_Merony.png/30px-Portrait_Merony.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/aa/Portrait_Merony.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Merony\" title=\"Merony\">Merony</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Reklan\" title=\"Reklan\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b3/Portrait_Reklan.png/30px-Portrait_Reklan.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b3/Portrait_Reklan.png/45px-Portrait_Reklan.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b3/Portrait_Reklan.png/60px-Portrait_Reklan.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Reklan\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b3/Portrait_Reklan.png/30px-Portrait_Reklan.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b3/Portrait_Reklan.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Reklan\" title=\"Reklan\">Reklan</a></li>\n</ul></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Conditions_with_the_same_stack_ID\"> Conditions with the same stack ID </span></h2>\nConditions with the <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">stack ID</a> <code>CHARMED</code>, only one of these can be applied at the same time:<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n  <th>Condition</th>\n  <th>Effects</th>\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Beguiled\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Beguiled_(Condition)\" title=\"Beguiled (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9d/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9d/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9d/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Beguiled\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9d/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9d/Legendary_Action_Crowd_Control_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Beguiled_(Condition)\" title=\"Beguiled (Condition)\">Beguiled</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>This creature has been charmed by <a href=\"/wiki/Raphael\" title=\"Raphael\">Raphael</a> and cannot target him with attacks or spells.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Charmed\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Charmed_(Condition)\" title=\"Charmed (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/47/Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/47/Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Charmed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/47/Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Charmed</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Cannot attack the spellcaster. The spellcaster has <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> on <a href=\"/wiki/Charisma\" title=\"Charisma\">Charisma</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability Check\">Checks</a> in dialogue.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Fiendish_Obeisance\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Fiendish_Obeisance_(Condition)\" title=\"Fiendish Obeisance (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/47/Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/47/Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Fiendish Obeisance\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/47/Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Fiendish_Obeisance_(Condition)\" title=\"Fiendish Obeisance (Condition)\">Fiendish Obeisance</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>Affected entity must obey the commands of the fiend directly controlling it.</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n<tr id=\"Spectator's_Charm\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Spectator%27s_Charm_(Condition)\" title=\"Spectator's Charm (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/47/Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/47/Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Spectator's Charm\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/47/Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Spectator%27s_Charm_(Condition)\" title=\"Spectator's Charm (Condition)\">Spectator's Charm</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<ul><li>A feeble enchantment prevents this creature from attacking the spectator. Any damage could break it...</li></ul>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195135\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.126 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.134 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 7229/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 130599/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 34819/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 28/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 4/1000\nLua time usage: 0.074/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1333945/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  111.156      1 -total\n 99.47%  110.572      1 Template:Condition_page\n 70.43%   78.292      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 58.14%   64.631      2 Template:Condition_sources\n 47.29%   52.568     16 Template:Condition_sources/format\n 32.62%   36.263     22 Template:Icon_link\n 32.30%   35.905     23 Template:Icon_text\n 27.39%   30.442     67 Template:Trim\n 19.79%   22.001     10 Template:MdSAI\n 10.84%   12.051     27 Template:Ifempty\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:5378-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714195135 and revision id 380363. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}